    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575-a1">

                <pb facs="0799" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg779"/>

                <head>Mr. Welles to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 10, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Referring to your letter of the 21st of
                    July last, and my reply of the 30th of that month, I have the honor to transmit
                    herewith a copy of a despatch dated the 26th of September, received from Acting
                    Rear-Admiral Charles H. Bell, relative to the two boys who escaped or deserted
                    from the British ship Cuzco and enlisted on board the United States ship St.
                    Mary’s.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GIDEON WELLES, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the
                        Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d575-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d575-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
